---
import Container from '@/components/ui/Container/Container.astro';
import Layout from '@/layouts/Layout.astro';

const year = new Date().toLocaleDateString('de-CH', { year: 'numeric' });
---

<Layout
  seo={{
    title: 'About me',
    description: 'Read more about myself, my interests, and my qualifications.',
  }}
>
  <Container>
    <article>
      <h1 class="visually-hidden">About me</h1>
      <p>
        My name is Sacha Schmid. I'm a front-end developer from Switzerland,
        interested in both user interface design and web development.
      </p>
      <p>
        I graduated with a BSc in Computer Science from the <a
          href="https://fhnw.ch/en/"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
        >
          University of Applied Sciences and Arts Northwestern Switzerland
        </a> (FHNW) in Brugg, Switzerland.
      </p>
      <dl>
        <dt>Bachelor of Science FHNW in Computer Science</dt>
        <dd>2017 – Specialisation in design and management</dd>
        <dt>Federal Diploma of Vocational Education and Training</dt>
        <dd>2013 – Specialisation in application development</dd>
      </dl>
      <p>
        I have experience in various aspects of front-end development, gained
        through work with companies and private clients as well as numerous
        personal projects. Examples of this work are available on my <a
          href="/projects/"
          data-astro-prefetch
        >
          projects
        </a> page.
      </p>
      <dl>
        <dt>Topics</dt>
        <dd>
          UI design, UX design, interaction design, web development, iOS native
          development, project management, software architecture
        </dd>
      </dl>
      <p>
        I stay current with the latest trends and the rapid evolution of
        languages and tools, regularly applying new technologies in my projects.
        This ongoing interest allows me to create websites and applications that
        build on foundational design principles while using cutting-edge
        technology.
      </p>
      <dl>
        <dt>Languages</dt>
        <dd>HTML, CSS, JS, PHP, C#, Swift</dd>
        <dt>Tools, Frameworks, Libraries</dt>
        <dd>
          <a
            href="https://react.dev/"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
          >
            React
          </a>, <a
            href="https://angular.dev/"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
          >
            Angular
          </a>, <a
            href="https://nextjs.org/"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
          >
            Next.js
          </a>, <a
            href="https://astro.build/"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
          >
            Astro
          </a>
        </dd>
      </dl>
      <p>
        Outside of web development, my interests include music, running, and
        photography.
      </p>
      <h2>About this site</h2>
      <p>
        This site was created with <a
          href="https://astro.build/"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
        >
          Astro
        </a>. It is hosted on <a
          href="https://github.com/"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
        >
          GitHub Pages
        </a>. You can also view <a
          href="https://github.com/RadLikeWhoa/radlikewhoa.github.io"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
        >
          the site's source
        </a>.
      </p>
      <p>
        All content, unless otherwise noted, was created by Sacha Schmid.
        Copyright © 2013 – {year}.
      </p>
    </article>
  </Container>
</Layout>

<style>
  article {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    padding-block: 4.5rem;
    gap: 1.5rem;

    :global(:is(h1, h2, h3)) {
      margin-block-start: 1.5rem;

      &:first-child {
        margin-block-start: 0;
      }
    }
  }
</style>
